# patches_lossless_gate_ab_lossless_trial_2026-05-17.tsv

## Provenance
- RFC#45 lossless chunk 5 — gate verdict vs empirical sign of bytes_off - bytes_on,
  validated against the new chunk-5 C=0.35 + lossless-shape trial encoder.

## Generation
```
cd jxl-encoder--lossless-patches-chunk5
cargo run --release -p jxl-encoder \
  --example patches_lossless_gate_ab \
  --features __internals \
  2>&1 | grep -E '^(class|screenshot|photo)' \
  > benchmarks/patches_lossless_gate_ab_lossless_trial_2026-05-17.tsv
```

## Provenance
- Parent commit (main@origin): ddc02a0212fd1d8ac4094184f79f4203fdcbf3a7
- Hostname: lilith
- Date: 2026-05-17 (UTC)

## Grid
- 5 gb82-sc screenshots (windows95, terminal, codec_wiki, imac_g3, windows)
- 5 CID22-512 photos (1025469, 1044329, 1189261, 1279330, 1418519)
- LosslessConfig::new() default profile (effort 7), chunk-5 gate active (C=0.35)

## Schema
class                        screenshot|photo
image                        file basename
width / height               pixels
bytes_off                    bytes with patches forced off
bytes_on                     bytes with patches=default (chunk-5 gate active)
delta_B                      bytes_off - bytes_on (positive => patches saved bytes)
total_patch_pixels           sum over occurrences of ref.xsize * ref.ysize
unique_refs                  PatchesData::ref_positions.len()
ref_frame_pixels             ref_width * ref_height
occurrences                  PatchesData::positions.len()
gate_says_effective          chunk-5 is_cost_effective_lossless(bit_depth=8, use_ans=true) verdict
empirical_win                delta_B > 0

## Results
- 5/5 screenshots: delta_B > 0 (patches saved 1110 .. 135091 bytes)
- 5/5 photos: delta_B = 0 (no patches detected, identical)
- 10/10 gate verdict matches empirical sign
- bytes_on identical to W11-1 (ad9964a6): same admission set, byte-for-byte

